      {
        "title": "Identified Gaps",
        "content": "\n**Untested Functions:**\n- Tool name extraction from heading\n- Random message selection\n- Message category matching\n\n**Missing Edge Cases:**\n- Missing or empty heading\n- Unknown tool names\n- All message categories\n- Random selection distribution\n\n",
