        "title": "Identified Gaps",
        "content": "\n**Untested Functions:**\n- Singleton socket management\n- Auth callback flow\n- CSRF integration\n- Transport configuration\n\n**Missing Edge Cases:**\n- Multiple initialization calls\n- Auth callback errors\n- connect_error handling\n- Environment variable configuration\n\n",
